{"4559340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "By the King's Command", "steam_appid": 4559340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559340/extras/f55e6e9cd92191af93295c9a4bd9d8ec.avif?t=1787998348\" width=1280 height=720 /></span>Build, expand, and defend your kingdom in this tight blend of city builder and real-time strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Start with a humble settlement and grow it into a thriving stronghold. Carefully place your buildings to maximize gold production Every decision matters, positioning, expansion, and gold will flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559340/extras/3896ffade6e772e2eed562926efc0a99.poster.avif?t=1787998348\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559340/extras/3896ffade6e772e2eed562926efc0a99.webm?t=1787998348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559340/extras/3896ffade6e772e2eed562926efc0a99.mp4?t=1787998348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Buy rougelike upgrades increasing your odds of winning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">When the invaders arrive, shift from planning to action. Command your forces in fast-paced, brutal real-time battles where smart tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Small in scale, deep in strategy, can you build a kingdom that endures?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559340/extras/e9aeab1cd4e88abed59918f89a601428.poster.avif?t=1787998348\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559340/extras/e9aeab1cd4e88abed59918f89a601428.webm?t=1787998348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559340/extras/e9aeab1cd4e88abed59918f89a601428.mp4?t=1787998348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559340/extras/f55e6e9cd92191af93295c9a4bd9d8ec.avif?t=1787998348\" width=1280 height=720 /></span>Build, expand, and defend your kingdom in this tight blend of city builder and real-time strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Start with a humble settlement and grow it into a thriving stronghold. Carefully place your buildings to maximize gold production Every decision matters, positioning, expansion, and gold will flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559340/extras/3896ffade6e772e2eed562926efc0a99.poster.avif?t=1787998348\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559340/extras/3896ffade6e772e2eed562926efc0a99.webm?t=1787998348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559340/extras/3896ffade6e772e2eed562926efc0a99.mp4?t=1787998348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></vide